{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/8d564f717561bddf90a3b58f63b5cc20.webp?t=1771174168\" width=776 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a journey through an alien world untouched by human beings, and ruled by cosmic forces like gravity, solar radiation, and hurricane winds... Visit dozens of exotic planets and meet a colourful cast of space-dwellers on the long road back towards your mysterious past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/3014556d6de72106cc3fc518e0698fdd.poster.avif?t=1771174168\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/3014556d6de72106cc3fc518e0698fdd.webm?t=1771174168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/3014556d6de72106cc3fc518e0698fdd.mp4?t=1771174168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/01c34cb91c7ed5e5221fed62c55b7c86.webp?t=1771174168\" width=776 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed and developed by one person over several years, Solaro is a self-contained world with original art, music, and gameplay. Experience immersive alien environments inspired by the wonders of space, and beautiful handcrafted levels with every detail designed from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/00d33816efba6573b5c2996f886b4737.poster.avif?t=1771174168\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/00d33816efba6573b5c2996f886b4737.webm?t=1771174168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/00d33816efba6573b5c2996f886b4737.mp4?t=1771174168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/60075945eda8663b5e76d7962bd56d6b.webp?t=1771174168\" width=776 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solaro's gameplay is inspired by concepts in physics and astronomy. Learn to navigate star systems using gravity, and contend with diverse atmospheres and weather systems across numerous alien worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/5e60b999171dd38022cfb930ef0ed735.webp?t=1771174168\" width=776 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and challenges unfold across a small open-world. The game is presented in a cryptic style, with room for exploration and experimentation, and lots of hidden secrets to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/7cc26f770e083913d533c29e2215b086.webp?t=1771174168\" width=776 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ vibrant alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ unique &quot;orbital puzzles&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12+ hours of core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12+ hours of optional features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ collectibles and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5 hours of original music </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602740?t=1771174168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/87cd48f6196a1a750d99a72843fda0e351b69231/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771174168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/a06ad42efb10787d83657d292d7f510bded38bf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771174168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/a06ad42efb10787d83657d292d7f510bded38bf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771174168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2801690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/8d564f717561bddf90a3b58f63b5cc20.webp?t=1771174168\" width=776 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a journey through an alien world untouched by human beings, and ruled by cosmic forces like gravity, solar radiation, and hurricane winds... Visit dozens of exotic planets and meet a colourful cast of space-dwellers on the long road back towards your mysterious past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets